+/// Normalize an inline-asm clobber or explicit register name to its bare register token.
+///
+/// GCC-style inline asm commonly accepts any of these spellings in clobber lists:
+/// - `"rcx"`
+/// - `"%rcx"`
+/// - `"~{rcx}"`
+/// - `"{rcx}"`
